{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "_cache = {1: 1, 2: 1}\ndef sequence(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the nth number in the Newman-Conway sequence using memoization.\n    It applies the recurrence relation a(n) = a(a(n-1)) + a(n - a(n-1)).\n    \"\"\"\n    if n in _cache:\n        return _cache[n]\n\n    val = sequence(sequence(n - 1)) + sequence(n - sequence(n - 1))\n    _cache[n] = val\n    return val"}
