{"task_id": "Mbpp/94", "solution": "def index_minimum(tuple_list):\n    \"\"\"\n    Returns the first value of the tuple with the smallest second value.\n    If multiple tuples share the minimal second value, the first encountered is chosen.\n    \"\"\"\n    min_first_value = tuple_list[0][0]\n    min_second_value = tuple_list[0][1]\n\n    for item in tuple_list[1:]:\n        current_second_value = item[1]\n        if current_second_value < min_second_value:\n            min_second_value = current_second_value\n            min_first_value = item[0]\n            \n    return min_first_value"}
