{"task_id": "Mbpp/131", "solution": "def reverse_vowels(input: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"\n    Reverse only the vowels in the input string, where 'y' is not considered a vowel.\n    All other characters and their positions remain unchanged.\n    \"\"\"\n    VOWELS = set('aeiouAEIOU')\n\n    vowel_indices = []\n    vowel_chars = []\n\n    for idx, char in enumerate(input):\n        if char in VOWELS:\n            vowel_indices.append(idx)\n            vowel_chars.append(char)\n\n    if not vowel_chars:\n        return input\n\n    vowel_chars.reverse()\n\n    result_list = list(input)\n    for i in range(len(vowel_indices)):\n        result_list[vowel_indices[i]] = vowel_chars[i]\n\n    return ''.join(result_list)"}
