{"task_id": "Mbpp/223", "solution": "def is_majority(array: list[int], n: int, element: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Determines if 'element' is the majority element in 'array'.\n    Returns True if element occurs > n/2 times, False otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def _find_first_occurrence(arr, length, target):\n        low, high = 0, length - 1\n        result = -1\n        while low <= high:\n            mid = low + (high - low) // 2\n            if arr[mid] == target:\n                result = mid\n                high = mid - 1\n            elif arr[mid] < target:\n                low = mid + 1\n            else:\n                high = mid - 1\n        return result\n\n    def _find_last_occurrence(arr, length, target):\n        low, high = 0, length - 1\n        result = -1\n        while low <= high:\n            mid = low + (high - low) // 2\n            if arr[mid] == target:\n                result = mid\n                low = mid + 1\n            elif arr[mid] < target:\n                low = mid + 1\n            else:\n                high = mid - 1\n        return result\n\n    if n == 0:\n        return False\n\n    first_idx = _find_first_occurrence(array, n, element)\n\n    if first_idx == -1:\n        return False\n\n    last_idx = _find_last_occurrence(array, n, element)\n\n    count = last_idx - first_idx + 1\n\n    return count > n // 2"}
