{"task_id": "Mbpp/252", "solution": "import math\nfrom typing import Union, Tuple\ndef convert(value: Union[int, float, complex]) -> Tuple[float, float]:\n    \"\"\"Converts a complex number or real number to its polar coordinates (magnitude, angle).\"\"\"\n    real_part = float(value.real)\n    imag_part = float(value.imag)\n\n    magnitude = math.sqrt(real_part**2 + imag_part**2)\n    angle = math.atan2(imag_part, real_part)\n\n    return (magnitude, angle)"}
