{"task_id": "Mbpp/265", "solution": "def list_split(list: list, n: int):\n    \"\"\"\n    Splits a list into n sub-lists by distributing elements based on their index modulo n.\n    Handles edge cases for n <= 0, empty lists, and n > list length as per design.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"n must be a positive integer\")\n\n    if not list:\n        return []\n\n    if n > len(list):\n        return [list]\n\n    result = [[] for _ in range(n)]\n    for i, item in enumerate(list):\n        result[i % n].append(item)\n    return result"}
