{"task_id": "Mbpp/283", "solution": "def validate(value: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if the frequency of each digit in an integer is less than or equal to the digit itself.\n    Counts digit occurrences and compares each count against its corresponding digit value.\n    \"\"\"\n    digit_counts = {}\n    for char_digit in str(abs(value)):\n        digit = int(char_digit)\n        digit_counts[digit] = digit_counts.get(digit, 0) + 1\n\n    for digit, count in digit_counts.items():\n        if count > digit:\n            return False\n            \n    return True"}
