{"task_id": "Mbpp/391", "solution": "def convert_list_dictionary(id_list, name_list, score_list):\n    \"\"\"\n    Converts three parallel lists (IDs, names, scores) into a list of nested dictionaries.\n    Each item in the result list is a dictionary mapping an ID to an inner dictionary of name to score.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not (len(id_list) == len(name_list) == len(score_list)):\n        raise ValueError(\"All input lists must have the same length.\")\n\n    result = []\n    for id_val, name_val, score_val in zip(id_list, name_list, score_list):\n        inner_dict = {name_val: score_val}\n        outer_dict = {id_val: inner_dict}\n        result.append(outer_dict)\n    return result"}
