{"task_id": "Mbpp/398", "solution": "def sum_of_digits(numbers):\n    \"\"\"\n    Computes the sum of digits for each number in a list and aggregates them.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_aggregated_sum = 0\n    for number in numbers:\n        current_number_digit_sum = 0\n        # Calculate sum of digits for the current number (DigitSumCalculator logic)\n        num_abs = abs(number)  # Handle potential negative numbers, though the example uses positive\n        if num_abs == 0:\n            current_number_digit_sum = 0\n        else:\n            while num_abs > 0:\n                current_number_digit_sum += num_abs % 10\n                num_abs //= 10\n        total_aggregated_sum += current_number_digit_sum\n    return total_aggregated_sum"}
