{"task_id": "Mbpp/422", "solution": "def find_Average_Of_Cube(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the average of the cubes of the first n natural numbers.\n    Uses a closed-form formula for efficient computation.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0.0\n    # The sum of the first n cubes is (n * (n + 1) / 2)^2\n    # The average is this sum divided by n: n * (n + 1)^2 / 4\n    average = n * (n + 1)**2 / 4\n    return float(average)"}
