{"task_id": "Mbpp/453", "solution": "def sumofFactors(number):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of all even factors of a given number.\n    Returns 0 if the number is less than or equal to 0, or has no even factors.\n    \"\"\"\n    if number <= 0:\n        return 0\n\n    total = 0\n    i = 1\n    while i * i <= number:\n        if number % i == 0:\n            if i % 2 == 0:\n                total += i\n            \n            counterpart = number // i\n            if counterpart != i and counterpart % 2 == 0:\n                total += counterpart\n        i += 1\n    return total"}
