{"task_id": "Mbpp/459", "solution": "def remove_uppercase(input_str: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"\n    Remove all contiguous uppercase substrings from the input string.\n    Returns a new string with all uppercase substrings removed.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not input_str:\n        return \"\"\n\n    result = []\n    i = 0\n    length = len(input_str)\n\n    while i < length:\n        if input_str[i].isupper():\n            # Skip contiguous uppercase letters\n            while i < length and input_str[i].isupper():\n                i += 1\n        else:\n            result.append(input_str[i])\n            i += 1\n\n    return \"\".join(result)"}
