{"task_id": "Mbpp/462", "solution": "def combinations_list(elements: list) -> list:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds all possible combinations (subsets) of the elements in the given list.\n    The order of elements within combinations reflects the order of processing.\n    \"\"\"\n    all_combinations = [[]]\n    for element in elements:\n        # For each existing combination, create a new one by prepending the current element.\n        new_combinations = [[element] + combination for combination in all_combinations]\n        # Add these new combinations to the list of all combinations.\n        all_combinations.extend(new_combinations)\n    return all_combinations"}
