{"task_id": "Mbpp/478", "solution": "def remove_lowercase(s):\n    \"\"\"Removes all contiguous lowercase substrings from a given string.\n\n    Characters that are not lowercase (e.g., uppercase letters, digits, symbols)\n    are retained unless they are part of a lowercase sequence.\n    \"\"\"\n    result_chars = []\n    i = 0\n    while i < len(s):\n        if s[i].islower():\n            # If the current character is lowercase, skip this entire lowercase sequence.\n            while i < len(s) and s[i].islower():\n                i += 1\n        else:\n            # If the current character is not lowercase (uppercase, digit, symbol, etc.),\n            # append it to the result and move to the next character.\n            result_chars.append(s[i])\n            i += 1\n    return \"\".join(result_chars)"}
