{"task_id": "Mbpp/563", "solution": "def extract_values(input_string: str) -> list[str]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Extracts all substrings enclosed in double quotation marks from the input string.\n    \"\"\"\n    result = []\n    in_quote = False\n    start_index = -1\n\n    for i, char in enumerate(input_string):\n        if char == '\"':\n            if not in_quote:\n                # Found an opening double quote\n                in_quote = True\n                start_index = i + 1\n            else:\n                # Found a closing double quote\n                in_quote = False\n                if start_index != -1:\n                    result.append(input_string[start_index:i])\n                start_index = -1 # Reset start_index after a segment is processed\n    return result"}
