{"task_id": "Mbpp/590", "solution": "def polar_rect(radius: float, angle: float) -> Tuple[Tuple[float, float], complex]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Convert polar coordinates to rectangular coordinates.\n    Returns the magnitude and angle, along with the complex rectangular form.\n    \"\"\"\n    import math\n    from typing import Tuple\n\n    magnitude = radius\n    real = radius * math.cos(angle)\n    imag = radius * math.sin(angle)\n    complex_number = complex(real, imag)\n    return ((magnitude, angle), complex_number)"}
