{"task_id": "Mbpp/790", "solution": "def even_position(lst):\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if every even index in the given list contains an even number.\n    Returns True if all even-indexed elements are even, False otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    for i, num in enumerate(lst):\n        if i % 2 == 0:  # Check only even indices\n            if num % 2 != 0:  # If the number at an even index is odd\n                return False\n    return True"}
