{"task_id": "Mbpp/806", "solution": "def max_run_uppercase(s: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Finds the maximum run of uppercase ASCII characters in the given string.\"\"\"\n    max_run = 0\n    current_run = 0\n    for char_code in s:\n        if 'A' <= char_code <= 'Z':\n            current_run += 1\n            if current_run > max_run:\n                max_run = current_run\n        else:\n            current_run = 0\n    return max_run"}
